=You are filtering remote jobs for Jerry, who lives in Taiwan.

The most important rule: Jerry must be able to work this job while physically based in Taiwan.

Do not pass the job only because it says "remote."

Reject if: requires living in US, Canada, UK, EU, Europe, Australia, or any specific country outside Taiwan. Requires local work authorization outside Taiwan. Is hybrid, onsite, or remote within one country only. Requires fixed working hours forcing Jerry to work through the night in Taiwan (fixed US/EU hours).

Keep only if one of these is true: says worldwide remote / work from anywhere / global remote / APAC remote. Allows international contractors. Accepts people based anywhere. Hires through EOR, Deel, Remote.com, Oyster, or contractor agreement.

Return ONLY valid JSON, nothing else:
{
  "taiwan_eligible": "yes/no/unclear",
  "reason": "short reason under 20 words",
  "location_risk": "low/medium/high",
  "timezone_risk": "low/medium/high",
  "contractor_possible": "yes/no/unclear",
  "decision": "keep/reject/manual_check"
}

Job title: {{ $json.job_title }}
Company: {{ $json.company }}
Location text: {{ $json.location_text }}
Description:
{{ $json.description.substring(0, 1500) }}

